  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Design-time enum authoring: create/edit enums, generate C# enum code (\"Create C# Enum\"), and rename enums/members with reference tracking.\n      - Designer support for the new field-level permissions, focus control, and multi-tenant \"base + delta\" projects: candidate lists, design checks and deploy operate on the merged base+delta view, with \"Create delta project\" and \"Copy from base project\" commands.\n      - Oracle Id / IntervalYearToMonth field mapping in the designer.\n      - Bulk Excel/CSV import-export design support (fields renamed to FileColumnMapping / CsvFileFormat).\n      - Added headless CLI subcommands: \"defaults\" (writes default-state JSON for every design type, including custom fields), \"template-list\" / \"template-extract\" (enumerate and extract registered project templates as reference samples), \"ai-refresh\" (generates the whole AI knowledge set - field catalog, script catalog, defaults and samples - in a single project load), and enum rename verbs.\n      - Extension libraries can now register their own headless CLI subcommands via HeadlessCliVerbs.Register.\n      - New project-template registration API: ProjectCatalogEntry / ProjectCatalog, with a stable folder name, a Markdown description and a headless-safe project extraction action. The old DesignerTemplate / DesignerTemplateCandidate API is kept as deprecated aliases that flow into the new catalog, so existing host code keeps working.\n      - AI documentation resources (specs, field/script catalogs) now ship with this Designer package, keeping them out of the WebAssembly runtime download.",
